-Two soft drinks.

228
00:13:31,268 --> 00:13:32,144
Surprise.

229
00:13:32,770 --> 00:13:33,604
Hi.

230
00:13:33,687 --> 00:13:35,731
-Hi.
-Ay, sorry.

231
00:13:35,815 --> 00:13:37,691
May band practice pa kasi kami.

232
00:13:38,234 --> 00:13:40,361
Akala ko fourth period pa
ang practice n'yo?

233
00:13:40,444 --> 00:13:43,781
Oo, pero may pina-practice kaming new set

234
00:13:43,864 --> 00:13:45,241
so hihintayin nila ako.

235
00:13:45,324 --> 00:13:46,909
Mag-skip ka na lang ng practice.

236
00:13:48,619 --> 00:13:50,162
Magbe-breakfast tayo.

237
00:13:55,334 --> 00:13:57,586
Sige, isang practice lang naman 'yon.

238
00:14:00,047 --> 00:14:00,923
Tama 'yan.

239
00:14:04,260 --> 00:14:05,094
Tara na.

240
00:14:13,394 --> 00:14:14,228
Salamat.

241
00:14:20,526 --> 00:14:23,028
Victoria. Hi. George.

242
00:14:23,612 --> 00:14:25,531
Sa wakas, nice to meet you.

243
00:14:25,614 --> 00:14:27,116
Oo nga. Salamat, pumunta ka.

244
00:14:27,199 --> 00:14:28,951
You're welcome.

245
00:14:29,034 --> 00:14:32,746
Nagustuhan ng family ko
'yong ginawa mong apple cider.

246
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:33,664
Salamat.

247
00:14:34,415 --> 00:14:37,668
Masaya ako na di nagsara
ang rantso mo last year

248
00:14:38,878 --> 00:14:40,921
at kami ang nako-consider mo

249
00:14:41,005 --> 00:14:43,257
na wine supplier sa new business mo.

250
00:14:44,216 --> 00:14:45,759
Well, 'yong tungkol diyan.

251
00:14:45,843 --> 00:14:48,721
May suggestion sana ako
kung paano tayo magtutulungan.

252
00:14:49,597 --> 00:14:50,472
Nakikinig ako.

253
00:14:50,973 --> 00:14:53,225
-Gusto mo ba ng kape?
-Sige.

254
00:14:59,982 --> 00:15:01,066
Para sa 'yo 'to.

255
00:15:07,489 --> 00:15:09,074
-Ang galing natin dito.
-Oo.

256
00:15:11,243 --> 00:15:12,077
Teka nga.

257
00:15:12,578 --> 00:15:15,331
May pastry chef professor sila
na galing pang Paris.

258
00:15:15,414 --> 00:15:18,250
-Sa France?
-Sa Kentucky, pero kahit na…

259
00:15:18,334 --> 00:15:20,920
Habang inaabot mo
ang patisserie dreams mo,

260
00:15:21,003 --> 00:15:22,546
sa Georgetown naman ako.

261
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:25,424
Maganda ang Indigenous studies
working group nila.

262
00:15:26,008 --> 00:15:27,217
Eh ikaw, Jackie?

263
00:15:27,301 --> 00:15:29,470
Masaya lang ako
na maayos 'tong college fair.

264
00:15:29,553 --> 00:15:30,471
Sabagay.

265
00:15:34,141 --> 00:15:36,685
Wala dapat bakanteng booth ngayon.

266
00:15:37,561 --> 00:15:38,687
Sandali lang, ha.

267
00:15:43,525 --> 00:15:44,568
You're welcome.

268
00:15:44,652 --> 00:15:46,362
Jackie, hi!

269
00:15:46,445 --> 00:15:48,781
Salamat, tinulungan mo ako dito.

270
00:15:48,864 --> 00:15:51,867
Saka ang laking tulong
no'ng Excel spreadsheets mo.

271
00:15:51,951 --> 00:15:53,243
Salamat.

272
00:15:53,327 --> 00:15:56,538
Pero bakit may bakanteng booths?
May problema ba?

273
00:15:56,622 --> 00:15:58,207
May ilang nag-cancel

274
00:15:58,290 --> 00:16:02,544
dahil sa scheduling conflicts,
may nagkasakit, at nasiraan ng kotse.

275
00:16:02,628 --> 00:16:04,838
Normal 'yon. Wag ka nang malungkot.

276
00:16:04,922 --> 00:16:05,756
Okay.

277
00:16:05,839 --> 00:16:08,592
Pakisabi sa students
'yong reps na di makakarating.

278
00:16:08,676 --> 00:16:10,970
-Maraming salamat talaga.
-You're welcome.

279
00:16:11,053 --> 00:16:13,722
Hi. Nandito ba si Pat Harris ng UT?

280
00:16:14,306 --> 00:16:18,268
Cole, pasensiya na,
pero nasiraan ng kotse si Mr. Harris.

281
00:16:19,603 --> 00:16:20,437
Gano'n ba?

282
00:16:22,231 --> 00:16:24,692
-Sige. Okay lang.
-Cole.

283
00:16:25,985 --> 00:16:32,866
What if, may taong magaling mag-ayos
ng kotse na tutulong kay Mr. Harris?

284
00:16:32,950 --> 00:16:36,829
Eh di pwede na silang
mag-one-on-one meeting tungkol sa UT.

285
00:16:36,912 --> 00:16:38,664
What if lang naman 'yon.

286
00:16:38,747 --> 00:16:40,958
Bawal kong utusang
mag-cutting ang students.

287
00:16:41,041 --> 00:16:45,421
Umangkas lang kasi ako kay Danny papasok,
so di ako makakaalis dito.

288
00:16:48,132 --> 00:16:50,384
-Gamitin mo 'yong kotse ko.
-Totoo po?

289
00:16:50,467 --> 00:16:52,886
-Manual 'yon. Marunong ka ba?
-Yes, ma'am.

290
00:16:52,970 --> 00:16:54,930
Kunin mo na 'to
bago pa magbago ang isip ko.

291
00:16:55,014 --> 00:16:56,181
Ingatan mo 'yon.

292
00:16:56,265 --> 00:17:00,519
Sasabihan ko si Pat na pupuntahan siya
ng best mechanic ng Silver Fall High.

293
00:17:00,602 --> 00:17:02,855
-Thank you.
-You're welcome. Good luck.

294
00:17:08,694 --> 00:17:09,570
Ayos ka lang ba?

295
00:17:10,070 --> 00:17:12,990
Chance mo na 'to
para mag-stand out sa ibang applicants.

296
00:17:13,073 --> 00:17:14,074
Puntahan mo na siya.

297
00:17:15,284 --> 00:17:16,118
Okay.

298
00:17:16,994 --> 00:17:18,996
Okay. Siguro nga.

299
00:17:21,206 --> 00:17:22,374
Good luck.

300
00:17:27,337 --> 00:17:30,132
Darating naman siguro
'yong mga bakante pa.

301
00:17:30,215 --> 00:17:32,009
Sky, mag-goldsmith kaya tayo?

302
00:17:32,092 --> 00:17:34,136
Paano kung may jewelry line ako?

303
00:17:34,219 --> 00:17:37,097
Ano'ng ipapangalan ko do'n?
A little bit of Grace.

304
00:17:37,181 --> 00:17:39,141
-Ang astig no'n.
-Kaya nga, eh!

305
00:17:51,487 --> 00:17:53,155
-Bye.
-Okay.

306
00:17:53,238 --> 00:17:55,199
Gusto mo bang umalis dito?

307
00:17:55,282 --> 00:17:56,158
Hindi.

308
00:17:58,035 --> 00:17:59,244
Susunod ako sa inyo.

309
00:18:00,579 --> 00:18:02,289
Kakausapin ko lang si Nathan.

310
00:18:06,335 --> 00:18:09,797
Okay. Well, okay 'tong isang 'to.

311
00:18:11,215 --> 00:18:12,049
Hi.

312
00:18:12,549 --> 00:18:13,467
Hi.

313
00:18:13,967 --> 00:18:16,386
Mukhang seryoso na kayo sa isa't isa, ah?

314
00:18:17,429 --> 00:18:18,263
Oo.

315
00:18:19,973 --> 00:18:21,850
Sino nang mga na-interview mo?

316
00:18:21,934 --> 00:18:22,893
Konti pa lang.

317
00:18:22,976 --> 00:18:24,061
Patingin.

318
00:18:27,981 --> 00:18:28,899
Okay.

319
00:18:30,067 --> 00:18:30,984
Makinig ka, Nate.

320
00:18:31,610 --> 00:18:33,862
Mahalaga sa relasyon ang honesty.

321
00:18:34,696 --> 00:18:36,573
Mag-iingat ka.

322
00:18:36,657 --> 00:18:38,117
May mga di ka pa alam.

323
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,410
Sige, papatol ako.
Ano 'yong di ko pa alam?

324
00:18:40,494 --> 00:18:42,204
Sa kanya mo dapat 'yan itanong.

325
00:18:44,123 --> 00:18:46,750
Ang gusto ko lang sabihin,

326
00:18:46,834 --> 00:18:51,338
kahit masaya ka ngayon, wag mong
papabayaan ang sarili mo para sa kanya.

327
00:18:51,421 --> 00:18:52,297
Skylar.

328
00:18:53,257 --> 00:18:54,466
Okay, fine.

329
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:58,262
Usapang honesty pala, eh.
Nag-aalala ka ba o nagseselos ka lang?

330
00:18:58,971 --> 00:19:01,473
Tama lang namang
nagselos ako sa inyo noon.

331
00:19:02,724 --> 00:19:05,144
Pero di eto 'yong Nate na nakilala ko.

332
00:19:05,727 --> 00:19:07,396
Di ko alam ang dapat kong sabihin.

333
00:19:07,479 --> 00:19:09,648
Baka di mo lang talaga ako
masyadong kilala.

334
00:19:13,902 --> 00:19:14,987
Gaya ng sinabi ko,

335
00:19:16,238 --> 00:19:17,322
mag-iingat ka.

336
00:19:17,948 --> 00:19:18,949
-Okay?
-Okay.

337
00:19:28,417 --> 00:19:29,334
Kyles!

338
00:19:29,418 --> 00:19:32,796
Nag-text ako sa 'yo tungkol
sa Confederacy of the Gods expansion pack.

339
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,965
Oo. Sorry. Busy ako kahapon.

340
00:19:35,549 --> 00:19:36,633
Ayos lang.

341
00:19:37,342 --> 00:19:39,761
Di biro ang dinner rush sa Monty's.

342
00:19:39,845 --> 00:19:42,472
Wala akong work kahapon. Lumabas ako.

343
00:19:42,556 --> 00:19:43,599
Lumabas ka?

344
00:19:43,682 --> 00:19:44,516
Oo.

345
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:49,563
Alam kong nakakagulat na di lang work
at video games ang ginagawa ko.

346
00:19:49,646 --> 00:19:51,273
-Di naman.
-So ano'ng kailangan mo?

347
00:19:51,356 --> 00:19:54,109
May girl problem ka ba
at sa 'kin ka magbe-vent out?

348
00:19:54,193 --> 00:19:56,820
Wala, ang tagal na kasi nating
di nag-uusap…

349
00:19:56,904 --> 00:19:59,239
Kasamahan mo sa rodeo
ang hingan mo ng tulong.

350
00:19:59,323 --> 00:20:00,574
May gagawin pa ako.

351
00:20:00,657 --> 00:20:01,783
Kiley.

352
00:20:01,867 --> 00:20:02,784
Uy.

353
00:20:03,285 --> 00:20:04,286
Kumusta?

354
00:20:04,369 --> 00:20:06,997
Ayos lang. Bye, Alex.

355
00:20:12,419 --> 00:20:15,130
-Ayos ka lang ba talaga?
-Oo.

356
00:20:15,214 --> 00:20:16,840
Ayos lang ako.

357
00:20:16,924 --> 00:20:20,219
'Yong kagabi nga pala, date 'yon.

358
00:20:20,302 --> 00:20:22,387
-Talaga?
-Oo.

359
00:20:24,139 --> 00:20:25,140
Good.

360
00:20:27,351 --> 00:20:30,103
-Si Lola 'to. Aalis na 'ko.
-Kailangan mo ng tulong?

361
00:20:30,604 --> 00:20:33,023
Lola? Bakit? Okay ka lang ba?

362
00:20:34,274 --> 00:20:35,609
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

363
00:20:35,692 --> 00:20:36,526
Okay, bye.

364
00:20:39,238 --> 00:20:40,405
Jackie.

365
00:20:40,489 --> 00:20:42,950
Nakaka-excite 'tong
social interaction na 'to.

366
00:20:43,033 --> 00:20:43,867
Kumusta?

367
00:20:43,951 --> 00:20:49,039
Alam n'yo, di ko na-gets
'yong pa-pizza voucher PTA n'yo before,

368
00:20:49,122 --> 00:20:52,584
pero okay 'tong event na ginawa n'yo.

369
00:20:52,668 --> 00:20:56,046
Pasok pala 'yong grades ko
sa University of Wisconsin-Madison?

370
00:20:56,129 --> 00:20:59,049
Nakakatuwang dahil sa fair
nagkaka-idea ka para sa future.

371
00:20:59,132 --> 00:21:02,261
Dapat ikaw at di si Paige
ang naging class president.

372
00:21:02,344 --> 00:21:05,180
Feeling ko di matutuloy
'yong trip to Hawaii project niya.

373
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:07,057
-Talaga?
-Mauuna na 'ko.

374
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:10,018
May one-on-one meeting pa ko
sa Northwestern.

375
00:21:10,769 --> 00:21:12,688
Tingnan mo nga naman.

376
00:21:12,771 --> 00:21:15,482
May mga nag-sign-up pa
so fully booked na tayo.

377
00:21:15,565 --> 00:21:18,944
Di ko sure no'ng una
kung magkakainteres dito ang juniors,

378
00:21:19,027 --> 00:21:20,487
pero pinatunayan mong mali ako.

379
00:21:20,570 --> 00:21:22,698
-Wala 'yon.
-Hindi.

380
00:21:22,781 --> 00:21:27,911
Dahil sa tulong mo, naramdaman ng students
na malayo ang mararating nila.

381
00:21:29,121 --> 00:21:31,039
May extra copies pa po kayo ng maps?

382
00:21:31,123 --> 00:21:33,250
-Naubusan na kasi kami.
-Meron do'n sa mesa ko.

383
00:21:33,333 --> 00:21:34,876
-Ayun.
-Thank you.

384
00:21:40,090 --> 00:21:40,924
Cole?

385
00:21:46,930 --> 00:21:50,100
Bakit nandito ka pa?
May nakalimutan ka ba?

386
00:21:50,183 --> 00:21:51,184
Wala.

387
00:21:51,268 --> 00:21:52,644
Ano kasi…

388
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:54,354
Bakit?

389
00:21:56,648 --> 00:21:58,191
Di pa ako ready na gawin 'yon.

390
00:21:58,942 --> 00:22:01,028
Kayang-kaya mo 'yon.

391
00:22:01,111 --> 00:22:02,779
Never ko pa 'yong naranasan.

392
00:22:02,863 --> 00:22:06,241
Ganito lang 'yong interview sa 'kin
ni Tony sa auto shop,

393
00:22:06,325 --> 00:22:08,577
"Mahilig ka sa kotse.
Dito ka na magtrabaho."

394
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:11,038
Oo, pero madali na lang 'yon
pag nando'n ka na.

395
00:22:11,121 --> 00:22:13,915
Pa'no kung may mali akong masabi?

396
00:22:13,999 --> 00:22:14,958
Di 'yan.

397
00:22:18,670 --> 00:22:19,504
Samahan mo 'ko.

398
00:22:22,174 --> 00:22:24,092
Gusto ko sana pero 'yong college fair…

399
00:22:24,176 --> 00:22:25,302
Please.

400
00:22:25,385 --> 00:22:27,179
Alam kong malaking pabor 'to.

401
00:22:33,894 --> 00:22:35,020
Okay.

402
00:22:37,189 --> 00:22:39,900
Ibibilin ko na lang 'tong event
kay Grace at Skylar.

403
00:22:41,818 --> 00:22:46,323
So, apat na storylines ang nabuo
sa pagbagsak ng bulalakaw

404
00:22:46,406 --> 00:22:49,785
bago 'yon nagsama-sama…
Well, ayokong maging spoiler.

405
00:22:50,535 --> 00:22:53,747
Gusto ko 'yang basahin.
Pahiram naman ako pagtapos mo diyan.

406
00:22:53,830 --> 00:22:55,082
Oo naman.

407
00:22:55,165 --> 00:22:55,999
Ayos.

408
00:22:58,085 --> 00:23:00,337
-Mamaya na lang, Alex.
-Bye.

409
00:23:05,509 --> 00:23:07,469
Ano'ng pinag-uusapan n'yo?

410
00:23:08,053 --> 00:23:10,055
Etong new sci-fi series.

411
00:23:10,138 --> 00:23:13,016
-So pagbagsak ng bulalakaw…
-Kaya pala parang bored na sila.

412
00:23:13,100 --> 00:23:14,017
Okay.

413
00:23:15,268 --> 00:23:16,812
Saan ka pupunta?

414
00:23:16,895 --> 00:23:17,729
Alam mo,

415
00:23:18,563 --> 00:23:23,485
di ko alam kung ano'ng nangyayari sa 'yo.
pero kung mag-a-attitude ka, aalis na 'ko.

416
00:23:23,568 --> 00:23:25,654
Alex, wait.

417
00:23:26,321 --> 00:23:27,697
Tungkol 'to kay Skylar.

418
00:23:35,789 --> 00:23:38,708
Binalaan niya ako kay Zach, pero ang labo,

419
00:23:38,792 --> 00:23:40,252
nase-stress tuloy ako.

420
00:23:40,335 --> 00:23:42,879
-Baka tama siya.
-Ano?

421
00:23:43,547 --> 00:23:45,966
Isang band practice lang naman
'yong di ko pinuntahan.

422
00:23:46,049 --> 00:23:48,093
-Gusto ko lang gawin 'yong hilig niya.
-Teka.

423
00:23:48,176 --> 00:23:50,095
Di ka pumunta sa band practice

424
00:23:50,178 --> 00:23:52,431
tapos nag-aaral kang mag-video game?

425
00:23:52,514 --> 00:23:54,933
Okay namang sumubok ng bago, di ba?

426
00:23:55,016 --> 00:23:56,017
Oo.

427
00:23:56,101 --> 00:23:59,729
Kung di mo pinagpapalit
'yong mga hilig mo para sa hilig niya.

428
00:24:00,647 --> 00:24:02,357
Okay, ewan ko. Baka nga tama ka.

429
00:24:02,441 --> 00:24:05,360
Siguro dapat itanong ko sa kanya
kung ano'ng tinutukoy ni Skylar.

430
00:24:05,444 --> 00:24:06,278
Oo.

431
00:24:07,320 --> 00:24:10,240
Wag ka na uling mag-skip sa band practice.

432
00:24:18,498 --> 00:24:21,710
Next question.
Paano mo ide-describe mo ang sarili mo?

433
00:24:22,502 --> 00:24:24,421
Ganito.

434
00:24:24,921 --> 00:24:27,007
Charming, guwapo…

435
00:24:27,090 --> 00:24:29,885
Okay. Mabuti confident ka na ulit.

436
00:24:29,968 --> 00:24:33,221
Siguro bilang fixer,

437
00:24:33,722 --> 00:24:36,057
kapag may bagay, gaya ng kotse,

438
00:24:36,850 --> 00:24:39,936
tinitingnan ko 'yong problema
at kung paano 'yon aaysuin.

439
00:24:41,438 --> 00:24:43,607
Sana gano'n din kadali ang buhay.

440
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:44,774
Good.

441
00:24:44,858 --> 00:24:46,067
Okay, New York.

442
00:24:46,943 --> 00:24:50,864
Ikaw nga.
Where do you see yourself in five years?

443
00:24:50,947 --> 00:24:54,367
Ang dali naman.
Eh di pa-graduate na ako sa Princeton.

444
00:24:54,451 --> 00:24:56,745
Oo nga pala.

445
00:24:56,828 --> 00:24:57,787
Oo.

446
00:24:59,873 --> 00:25:01,124
Kaya ko na 'tong gawin.

447
00:25:02,209 --> 00:25:04,127
Oh di ba? Sabi ko na, eh.

448
00:25:04,211 --> 00:25:07,172
Pag prepared ka,
makukuha mo ang lahat ng gusto mo.

449
00:25:07,881 --> 00:25:08,965
Lahat?

450
00:25:11,593 --> 00:25:15,472
Pwedeng mangarap nang mataas ang lahat,
lalo na ang friends ko.

451
00:25:15,972 --> 00:25:16,890
Isa ka na do'n.

452
00:25:18,433 --> 00:25:19,684
Okay.

453
00:25:24,773 --> 00:25:26,399
-Hi.
-Hi, Grace.

454
00:25:26,483 --> 00:25:28,151
-Hi.
-Nakita mo ba si Jackie?

455
00:25:28,235 --> 00:25:30,445
Nasa biyahe pa yata sila ni Cole.

456
00:25:30,529 --> 00:25:31,404
Sila ni Cole?

457
00:25:33,156 --> 00:25:35,700
Oo. Nasiraan kasi ng kotse 'yong rep.

458
00:25:36,243 --> 00:25:38,370
Wala lang 'yon. School related 'yon.

459
00:25:38,453 --> 00:25:42,374
Ime-meet nila 'yong baduy na college rep.

460
00:25:43,124 --> 00:25:45,835
Okay, ite-text ko na lang siya.

461
00:25:45,919 --> 00:25:46,753
Okay.

462
00:25:49,923 --> 00:25:53,468
Simula no'n, naging assistant coach ako
ng team ng school.

463
00:25:53,552 --> 00:25:56,137
Mahirap mag-lead
ng kapwa mo high school students.

464
00:25:56,221 --> 00:25:57,472
Opo, di madali.

465
00:26:00,517 --> 00:26:03,103
Salamat pumayag kayong gawin 'to.

466
00:26:03,603 --> 00:26:05,939
Wala 'yon. Salamat sa tulong mo.

467
00:26:06,523 --> 00:26:07,440
Walang anuman.

468
00:26:07,524 --> 00:26:09,317
May isa pa 'kong tanong.

469
00:26:10,777 --> 00:26:13,238
Paano ka kaya ide-describe ng friends mo?

470
00:26:20,078 --> 00:26:21,121
Siguro

471
00:26:22,706 --> 00:26:25,917
sasabihin nilang ibang-iba na ako ngayon,

472
00:26:26,001 --> 00:26:27,961
at di ako palaging tama.

473
00:26:28,670 --> 00:26:32,173
Pero pag nagkakamali ako,
pinipilit kong ayusin 'yon.

474
00:26:33,425 --> 00:26:37,304
Nakakatuwa 'yong marinig.
Di lang perfect grades ang hanap namin.

475
00:26:37,387 --> 00:26:40,390
Mahalaga din
ang pagiging matatag at determinado.

476
00:26:42,350 --> 00:26:43,810
Naku. Agad-agad?

477
00:26:44,603 --> 00:26:48,648
Mukhang okay na po 'tong kotse n'yo.

478
00:26:48,732 --> 00:26:49,566
Okay.

479
00:26:49,649 --> 00:26:54,487
May isa na lang akong kailangang gawin,
tapos pwede n'yo na 'tong gamitin.

480
00:26:55,488 --> 00:26:57,240
-Salamat.
-Walang anuman.

481
00:27:07,459 --> 00:27:10,462
Alam kong di ka interesado
sa community college.

482
00:27:11,546 --> 00:27:15,050
Hindi nga. Pero interesado akong mag-sorry

483
00:27:15,133 --> 00:27:17,969
sa babaeng gustong mag-aral
sa community college.

484
00:27:22,599 --> 00:27:25,185
Sorry kasi…

485
00:27:26,811 --> 00:27:30,690
Kasi di kita pinakinggan.
Akala ko pareho nating hilig ang acting.

486
00:27:30,774 --> 00:27:32,233
Nagkamali ako.

487
00:27:33,777 --> 00:27:36,071
Naiintindihan ko kung bakit break na tayo.

488
00:27:36,780 --> 00:27:40,575
Danny, normal ang mag-away.
Di ibig sabihin no'n hiwalay na tayo.

489
00:27:41,284 --> 00:27:43,662
Maliban kung 'yon ang gusto mo.

490
00:27:43,745 --> 00:27:44,871
Hindi.

491
00:27:44,954 --> 00:27:46,873
Siyempre hindi.

492
00:27:46,956 --> 00:27:49,376
Mabuti naman.
Tinatanggap ko na ang sorry mo.

493
00:27:51,419 --> 00:27:55,423
Gaya ng sinabi ko,
masaya ang acting, pero mahirap 'yon.

494
00:27:55,507 --> 00:27:58,176
-Tiwala naman ako sa skills ko.
-Alam ko 'yon.

495
00:27:59,427 --> 00:28:01,930
Ayoko lang na masaktan ka.

496
00:28:02,764 --> 00:28:05,475
Mas okay kung magiging realistic tayo.

497
00:28:05,558 --> 00:28:07,268
So unrealistic pala ako?

498
00:28:07,852 --> 00:28:10,188
Di 'yan ang ibig kong sabihin.

499
00:28:10,689 --> 00:28:12,482
Alam mo kung ano'ng realistic?

500
00:28:13,316 --> 00:28:16,611
Ang mag-apply
sa business schools sa New York.

501
00:28:16,695 --> 00:28:20,156
Magastos ang applications.
Di ko nga 'yon afford.

502
00:28:20,240 --> 00:28:22,242
May fee waivers naman.

503
00:28:22,742 --> 00:28:24,744
May scholarships din. Subukan mo lang.

504
00:28:24,828 --> 00:28:27,747
Di ko pwedeng ibase sa 'yo
'yong mga desisyon ko.

505
00:28:27,831 --> 00:28:30,917
Pipiliin ko 'yong makakabuti sa 'kin.
May plano ako.

506
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:34,212
Oo, pero sana magkasama tayong nagplano.

507
00:28:35,463 --> 00:28:39,008
Pero hindi, eh,
para mo akong inalis sa future mo.

508
00:28:41,928 --> 00:28:45,557
Di ko alam
na may expiration date pala tayo.

509
00:28:47,267 --> 00:28:48,101
Danny.

510
00:29:00,029 --> 00:29:02,866
-Narinig mo ba 'yon?
-Oo, ang ganda ng naging interview mo.

511
00:29:02,949 --> 00:29:07,036
Tinanong ko 'yong tungkol sa grades ko.
May coaching experience naman daw ako.

512
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:09,205
Natutuwa ako na masaya ka.

513
00:29:11,040 --> 00:29:13,626
Uy. Ayos ka lang ba?

514
00:29:14,794 --> 00:29:16,755
Di na ako aabot sa final mock driving ko.

515
00:29:16,838 --> 00:29:18,715
Naku, Jackie, sorry.

516
00:29:18,798 --> 00:29:22,469
Wag mo na 'yong isipin.
Papakiusapan ko na lang si Coach Allen.

517
00:29:22,552 --> 00:29:25,513
Wait. Eh kung mag-practice ka ngayon?

518
00:29:26,514 --> 00:29:28,057
Ha ha, patawa ka rin, 'no?

519
00:29:28,141 --> 00:29:28,975
Seryoso ako.

520
00:29:29,058 --> 00:29:33,354
-Never pa 'kong nag-drive ng manual.
-Kaya mo 'yan. Tuturuan kita.

521
00:29:33,438 --> 00:29:34,939
Tuturuan kita. Tara.

522
00:29:35,940 --> 00:29:36,816
Tara.

523
00:29:46,701 --> 00:29:48,828
Eto kaya ang gawin kong cover photo?

524
00:29:49,829 --> 00:29:51,331
Di 'yan pwede.

525
00:29:51,414 --> 00:29:53,917
Gusto ko lang
na makita nila 'yong nakikita ko.

526
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:57,837
Ang hottest, coolest, sweetest guy ever.

527
00:30:00,757 --> 00:30:04,469
Zach, may nangyari ba
sa inyo ni Skylar before?

528
00:30:05,178 --> 00:30:07,013
May sinabi ba siya sa 'yo?

529
00:30:08,765 --> 00:30:12,936
Di porke iniwan mo siya
kasi di ka niya binibigyan ng oras…

530
00:30:13,019 --> 00:30:14,187
Ano'ng nangyari sa inyo?

531
00:30:17,232 --> 00:30:18,066
Okay.

532
00:30:19,734 --> 00:30:20,860
Okay, yes.

533
00:30:24,447 --> 00:30:28,159
Oo. May nangyari sa 'min ni Skylar noon.

534
00:30:30,787 --> 00:30:32,205
Sophomore ako no'n.

535
00:30:32,288 --> 00:30:33,790
Di pa ako nag-a-out no'n.

536
00:30:35,750 --> 00:30:38,253
Pero may nangyayari na sa 'min ni Skylar.

537
00:30:40,338 --> 00:30:43,633
Pero no'ng tumagal,
palagi na lang siyang busy.

538
00:30:44,634 --> 00:30:49,222
Palaging Student Council
o newspaper ang inaasikaso niya.

539
00:30:49,722 --> 00:30:52,392
Kaya nga ako sumali do'n,
para mas maging malapit kami.

540
00:30:52,475 --> 00:30:55,937
Pero kahit ano'ng gawin ko
para mag-focus siya sa 'kin,

541
00:30:56,020 --> 00:30:57,897
busy pa rin siya lagi.

542
00:30:57,981 --> 00:30:59,107
Bandang huli,

543
00:31:00,149 --> 00:31:03,528
sinabi niya na ang gusto niyang makasama
'yong taong nakapag-out na.

544
00:31:05,697 --> 00:31:06,990
So nag-out ako.

545
00:31:07,824 --> 00:31:08,908
Eventually.

546
00:31:10,159 --> 00:31:12,161
Pero kayo na no'n.

547
00:31:14,664 --> 00:31:15,957
So wait…

548
00:31:17,458 --> 00:31:21,546
Ginagantihan mo ba si Skylar
o gusto mong makipagbalikan sa kanya?

549
00:31:21,629 --> 00:31:22,505
Hindi.

550
00:31:23,381 --> 00:31:24,883
Hindi, Nathan.

551
00:31:25,383 --> 00:31:27,385
Balewala na 'yon, tapos na 'yon.

552
00:31:29,137 --> 00:31:30,346
Di na 'yon mahalaga.

553
00:31:35,226 --> 00:31:36,060
Ma…

554
00:31:36,686 --> 00:31:37,770
Mahalaga 'yon.

555
00:31:51,409 --> 00:31:52,911
Darating pa ba si Jackie?

556
00:31:55,914 --> 00:31:57,248
PAPUNTA KA NA BA?

557
00:31:57,332 --> 00:32:00,668
Di ko na 'to dapat ipaalala,
pero no texting and driving.

558
00:32:02,170 --> 00:32:03,087
Tara na.

559
00:32:05,465 --> 00:32:06,883
Papunta na siya.

560
00:32:21,940 --> 00:32:25,818
Alam mo, pag-uwi ko,
'yong seven-months-pregnant wife ko,

561
00:32:25,902 --> 00:32:29,864
inaasahan niyang
may nailuto na akong dinner by 6:30.

562
00:32:29,948 --> 00:32:31,866
So pwedeng sundin mo 'yong speed limit?

563
00:32:32,784 --> 00:32:33,868
Di pwede.

564
00:32:34,452 --> 00:32:35,828
-Ano 'ka mo?
-Sorry.

565
00:32:35,912 --> 00:32:41,042
Busy po kasi sa college fair si Jackie,

566
00:32:41,125 --> 00:32:43,628
at alam kong
mahalaga sa kanya 'tong final run,

567
00:32:43,711 --> 00:32:45,213
so di ko po pwedeng bilisan.

568
00:32:45,713 --> 00:32:48,883
Okay. Hihintayin natin siya.

569
00:32:54,973 --> 00:32:56,933
Okay. Dahan-dahan. Sa kalye ka tumingin.

570
00:33:03,481 --> 00:33:04,607
-Okay.
-Perfect.

571
00:33:05,566 --> 00:33:07,568
-Sa highway naman.
-Seryoso ka ba?

572
00:33:07,652 --> 00:33:09,195
Oo. Kaya mo 'yan.

573
00:33:12,156 --> 00:33:12,991
Okay.

574
00:33:21,457 --> 00:33:24,460
Pakiramdaman mo 'yong kotse
habang umaandar. Okay?

575
00:33:24,544 --> 00:33:25,795
Apakan mo ang clutch.

576
00:33:29,590 --> 00:33:30,717
Dahan-dahan lang.

577
00:33:31,926 --> 00:33:33,094
Humawak ka sa kambiyo.

578
00:33:34,262 --> 00:33:35,930
Good. Ngayon na.

579
00:33:45,356 --> 00:33:46,607
Dahan-dahan lang.

580
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:49,193
-Magshi-shift ka ulit.
-Kaya ko na 'to.

581
00:33:59,620 --> 00:34:00,538
Pasok ka.

582
00:34:03,207 --> 00:34:04,250
Hi, Katherine.

583
00:34:05,001 --> 00:34:06,544
Ano'ng ginagawa mo dito?

584
00:34:07,295 --> 00:34:08,713
Gusto kitang makausap.

585
00:34:12,258 --> 00:34:14,260
Sorry, nasira 'yong kulungan ng manok.

586
00:34:15,553 --> 00:34:20,475
Pero okay lang na ikaw na
ang nagdedesisyon para sa project?

587
00:34:20,558 --> 00:34:23,227
Kailangan na naming makita
na babalik 'yong puhunan

588
00:34:23,311 --> 00:34:24,979
at saka para mapabilis na.

589
00:34:25,063 --> 00:34:27,398
Gusto ng investors ng
malinaw na plano at desisyon,

590
00:34:27,482 --> 00:34:29,650
at alam mong laging umaatras si George.

591
00:34:29,734 --> 00:34:33,821
Si Will naman, junior partner ko siya,
at magaling siya.

592
00:34:34,322 --> 00:34:37,366
Pero dapat turuan pa siya.
Ngayon lang siya gagawa ng ganito.

593
00:34:37,450 --> 00:34:40,578
Alam kong di kami okay financially,

594
00:34:40,661 --> 00:34:42,330
at eto ang kailangang gawin.

595
00:34:43,748 --> 00:34:46,542
Pero kung nasasaktan na
ang asawa at anak ko,

596
00:34:46,626 --> 00:34:47,794
di ko matatanggap 'yon.

597
00:34:47,877 --> 00:34:50,630
Wala sa 'yo ang desisyon
pag pera ng iba ang pinag-uusapan!

598
00:34:54,926 --> 00:34:57,345
Magkano ang pinuhunan mo dito
na sarili mong pera?

599
00:34:58,179 --> 00:35:00,807
-Wag mo nang alalahanin 'yon.
-Sabihin mo na.

600
00:35:05,937 --> 00:35:10,608
Di ko nakumbinsi 'yong investors
sa halaga na kailangan natin,

601
00:35:10,691 --> 00:35:13,069
so inabonohan ko 'yong kulang.

602
00:35:13,986 --> 00:35:16,531
Umutang ako,
at apartment ko ang collateral.

603
00:35:17,031 --> 00:35:18,032
-Na…
-Diyos ko po.

604
00:35:19,450 --> 00:35:24,831
Naisip ko na kung tutulong ako, baka
maisalba ko 'yong tinutuluyan ni Jackie.

605
00:35:24,914 --> 00:35:26,874
Saka para makasama ko siya.

606
00:35:28,501 --> 00:35:30,419
Siya na lang ang pamilya ko.

607
00:35:32,630 --> 00:35:36,717
Gusto kong ma-feel niyang
may lugar at ligtas siya.

608
00:35:39,428 --> 00:35:41,556
Ayoko nang dagdagan
'yong mga pinagdaanan niya.

609
00:35:41,639 --> 00:35:44,600
Naiintindihan kita, Richard.

610
00:35:47,895 --> 00:35:50,314
Pero di mo kailangang gawin 'yon.

611
00:35:50,398 --> 00:35:52,191
Nakakagawa naman kami ng paraan.

612
00:35:52,275 --> 00:35:53,276
Talaga ba?

613
00:35:53,359 --> 00:35:54,527
Oo, palagi.

614
00:35:55,403 --> 00:35:56,904
Gusto kong malaman mo

615
00:35:57,405 --> 00:36:01,284
na welcome ka dito sa bahay dahil
pamilya na rin ang turing namin sa 'yo.

616
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:03,870
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

617
00:36:03,953 --> 00:36:05,371
May pakiusap lang ako?

618
00:36:05,454 --> 00:36:07,165
Mamimilit ka pa rin ba?

619
00:36:09,542 --> 00:36:12,879
Ako na ang magsasabi nito kay George.
Dapat sa 'kin 'to magmula.

620
00:36:16,340 --> 00:36:17,341
Okay, sige.

621
00:36:19,802 --> 00:36:20,803
Salamat.

622
00:36:23,973 --> 00:36:26,017
-Late ka na.
-Opo. Sorry.

623
00:36:26,100 --> 00:36:29,228
Mabuti na lang
nakumbinsi ako ni Alex na hintayin ka.

624
00:36:29,312 --> 00:36:31,272
So bibigyan pa rin kita ng chance.

625
00:36:31,355 --> 00:36:32,565
Tara na.

626
00:36:44,577 --> 00:36:48,331
Ang galing mo,
pinilit mong hintayin siya ni Coach Allen.

627
00:36:50,625 --> 00:36:51,584
Wala 'yon.

628
00:36:55,546 --> 00:36:56,797
Okay ba 'yong meeting mo?

629
00:36:57,798 --> 00:36:58,633
Oo.

630
00:37:00,051 --> 00:37:01,010
Mukhang okay naman.

631
00:37:04,388 --> 00:37:05,223
Good.

632
00:37:10,561 --> 00:37:11,520
Skylar?

633
00:37:13,522 --> 00:37:14,565
Ano'ng kailangan mo?

634
00:37:15,691 --> 00:37:17,902
Gusto kitang makausap tungkol kay Nathan.

635
00:37:17,985 --> 00:37:19,654
Wala na tayong dapat pag-usapan.

636
00:37:20,238 --> 00:37:22,740
Inagaw mo ang boyfriend ko
para lang ipakitang kaya mo.

637
00:37:23,241 --> 00:37:24,575
Di gano'n 'yon.

638
00:37:25,117 --> 00:37:26,244
Eh ano pala?

639
00:37:26,744 --> 00:37:30,122
Dahil ba sa paghihiwalay natin?
Galit ka pa rin ba dahil do'n?

640
00:37:31,165 --> 00:37:32,291
Siyempre oo.

641
00:37:32,375 --> 00:37:36,587
Magkaiba lang tayo ng sitwasyon noon,
walang ibang kahulugan 'yon.

642
00:37:36,671 --> 00:37:38,923
Pareho na tayo ng sitwasyon ngayon.

643
00:37:40,716 --> 00:37:44,178
-Nag-out na 'ko. Pareho na tayong single.
-Ano?

644
00:37:44,762 --> 00:37:47,265
Hiwalay na kami ni Nathan.

645
00:37:48,057 --> 00:37:49,267
Pambihira.

646
00:37:51,102 --> 00:37:53,479
Ang tindi mo.

647
00:37:54,689 --> 00:37:56,315
Makinig ka, Skylar…

648
00:37:57,817 --> 00:37:59,443
Gusto ko si Nathan…

649
00:38:00,820 --> 00:38:04,407
Pero sa totoo lang,
gusto ko lang na mapansin mo 'ko.

650
00:38:04,490 --> 00:38:06,409
Well, napansin na kita.

651
00:38:06,492 --> 00:38:07,451
Sky!

652
00:38:08,869 --> 00:38:11,580
-Miss na kita.
-Ano'ng ibig mong sabihin?

653
00:38:12,164 --> 00:38:13,624
Gusto kong maging tayo ulit.

654
00:38:23,384 --> 00:38:26,345
Di ko alam na gising ka pa.
Akala ko tulog na kayo.

655
00:38:27,305 --> 00:38:28,139
Tulog na sila.

656
00:38:29,390 --> 00:38:32,935
Magpapasalamat lang ako
sa pagkumbinsi mo kay Coach Allen.

657
00:38:33,811 --> 00:38:35,938
Actually, nabuwisit na siya,

658
00:38:36,022 --> 00:38:38,274
pero alam kong mahalaga 'yon sa 'yo.

659
00:38:38,357 --> 00:38:40,276
Mabuti di ka niya pinatakbo?

660
00:38:40,359 --> 00:38:41,986
Well, muntik na.

661
00:38:44,405 --> 00:38:45,364
Nga pala…

662
00:38:46,741 --> 00:38:48,451
Sorry talaga.

663
00:38:49,076 --> 00:38:49,910
Para saan?

664
00:38:49,994 --> 00:38:53,622
Dapat nagsabi akong
magka-cutting ako kasama si Cole.

665
00:38:53,706 --> 00:38:55,875
Jackie. Dapat ba akong magselos?

666
00:38:55,958 --> 00:38:57,251
Siyempre hindi.

667
00:38:57,335 --> 00:38:59,462
Hinding-hindi.

668
00:38:59,545 --> 00:39:00,713
Ayos na 'yon.

669
00:39:02,381 --> 00:39:04,175
-Talaga?
-Oo.

670
00:39:09,013 --> 00:39:11,807
Saka dapat sumagot ako no'ng isang araw.

671
00:39:13,351 --> 00:39:15,061
I love you too.

672
00:39:38,584 --> 00:39:39,502
Okay.

673
00:39:39,585 --> 00:39:42,421
Mas matangkad ka na pala sa 'kin? Grabe.

674
00:39:44,006 --> 00:39:45,508
Coach!

675
00:39:45,591 --> 00:39:47,676
-Cole, sandali lang.
-Bakit po?

676
00:39:47,760 --> 00:39:51,722
Ayaw kitang i-pressure no'ng araw na 'yon,
pero kakilala ko 'yong rep sa UT.

677
00:39:51,806 --> 00:39:54,141
Di sila nagpapadala ng reps dito,

678
00:39:54,225 --> 00:39:56,519
pero 'ka ko, kailangan ka nilang ma-meet.

679
00:39:56,602 --> 00:39:57,520
Talaga po?

680
00:39:58,354 --> 00:39:59,522
Salamat, Coach.

681
00:39:59,605 --> 00:40:01,899
Oo. Deserve mo 'yon.

682
00:40:01,982 --> 00:40:04,443
Ang daming feedback ng rep sa 'yo.

683
00:40:04,527 --> 00:40:06,237
Natutuwa siya sa 'yo.

684
00:40:06,821 --> 00:40:09,657
Pipilitin niya raw na makapasok ka
pag admission-decision na.

685
00:40:09,740 --> 00:40:11,117
Thank you, Coach…

686
00:40:11,659 --> 00:40:13,911
Kung makakapasok ako,
di ko kayo ipapahiya.

687
00:40:13,994 --> 00:40:16,038
Mali, makakapasok ka.

688
00:40:16,664 --> 00:40:19,208
Okay, tara na.
May announcement ako sa team.

689
00:40:19,291 --> 00:40:21,836
Wag n'yo na pong banggitin sa kanila.

690
00:40:23,379 --> 00:40:25,381
Sana nga tungkol diyan ang ia-announce ko.

691
00:40:28,426 --> 00:40:29,260
Ano?

692
00:40:30,469 --> 00:40:32,596
Okay, team. Magdamit kayo.

693
00:40:33,764 --> 00:40:34,807
Di ba, may practice?

694
00:40:34,890 --> 00:40:38,602
Pumasok sa weed shop
ang Lockwood soccer team

695
00:40:38,686 --> 00:40:42,606
gamit ang fake IDs
tapos nagpaka-high nang sobra.

696
00:40:42,690 --> 00:40:44,984
So ngayon,
pinagda-drug test ang lahat ng teams.

697
00:40:46,152 --> 00:40:49,363
Pero wag kayong mag-alala.
Standard procedure lang 'to.

698
00:40:49,447 --> 00:40:51,657
Pati si Coach Walter, ida-drug test.

699
00:40:52,408 --> 00:40:55,119
Okay, kayo muna. Kilos.

700
00:40:59,915 --> 00:41:03,377
Tol, babagsak ako sa drug test.
Nag-smoke ako sa rodeo.

701
00:41:03,461 --> 00:41:06,005
Di ka lang naman paglalaruin
ng ilang games.

702
00:41:06,088 --> 00:41:07,798
